  "description": "Watch now | A 2-minute recap of this week's market and stock ideas",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Friday! We had a wonderful week in the market. After job losses were posted today, the market began re-bounding. In this video I explain the reasoning behind the market rally…and how in the broader, more long term picture, why it does not really matter. </p><p>Overall, I expect another continuation of the bull market…however anything is possible, and I will continue to update you day to day. </p><p>If you missed any of these posts this week, check them out when you have a moment:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/finallyim-buying-again?r=4z8lgl\">Stocks I Bought This Week</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/reviewed-27-stocks-one-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">Top Stock of 27 Reviewed…</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/we-are-in-bull-market-stop-shorting?r=4z8lgl\">Stop Shorting The Market!</a></p></li></ul><p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out and tag me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/f0cce345-4d01-43b4-87c8-60102042ebb8\">Main Chat</a>. I take weekends off for the most part, but do periodically check my notifications. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Have a great weekend, be sure to take a break and refresh your mind. I will see you Monday! </p><h4>Be sure to LIKE ❤️ and Re-Stack please! </h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-is-rooting-for-job-losses?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-is-rooting-for-job-losses?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p>",
